# [[hi]]

====Usage notes====
The use of {{term|hæ|lang=is}} and {{term|bæ|lang=is}} (corresponding to English {{term|hi|lang=en}} and {{term|bye|lang=en}}, respectively) is often frowned upon, especially among older people. The greetings {{term|sæll|lang=is}} and {{term|blessaður}} (both of course declined in terms of gender and number) and/or the undeclined (and slightly less formal) {{term|bless|lang=is}} should be used instead.

